=== start ===
I designed the core movement mechanics to feel incredibly fun, floaty, and slidy, drawing heavy inspiration from games like Splatoon and Ultrakill.
Want to hear how I scoped the movement system?
+ [Yes] -> technical_detail
+ [No] -> END

=== technical_detail ===
I initially designed a high-mobility kit, including a red grappling hook, blue color-skating, and yellow satchel boosting. 

... but time constraints exist...

So to ensure that we deliver a polished product on time, I scoped down those ideas.
focusing instead on perfecting the weight, slide friction, and responsiveness of our core movement physics so the fundamental navigation felt great to play.
-> END